# LINE-ENDING LAW (I-97). The repo objects are LF. A Windows worktree that rewrites
# the tree to CRLF produces a phantom diff across every tracked file — 169 files
# "modified" with zero content change, which is how the 2026-08-03 resume found it.
# The I-83 session learned this by hand (`sed -i 's/\r$//'` before `git add`);
# this file makes the lesson structural so it cannot recur.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries — never eol-normalized, never diffed as text.
*.docx binary
*.pdf  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.JPG  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico  binary
